    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d137">

                <pb facs="0286" n="154" xml:id="pg154"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 EW/7–1245:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 137 <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-07-12T17:00:00-04:00">July 12, 1945—5
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>5701. For the Ambassador.</p>
                <p>Yesterday we had an oral inquiry from Halifax concerning the day on which the President and the
                    Secretary would arrive at <hi rendition="#small-caps">Terminal</hi>. Halifax explained that the Prime Minister and
                        Eden wished to time their departure in
                    such a way as to arrive on the same day as the President and the Secretary.</p>
                <p>We communicated with the Secretary and have now been informed that the present
                    schedule is arranged to permit arrival at <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >Terminal</hi> about 3 p.m. local time Sunday, July 15. The Secretary asked
                    that we inform you of this. We have informed Halifax.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                        
                        <lb/>
                        J[ohn] D H[ickerson]
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
